                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Germany and Austria</hi></p>
                <p>Proposals were tabled by the U.S. Delegation (CFM(46)
                        (NY)57, 58, 59)<anchor n="50" xml:id="d396-f1"/> and by the U.S.S.R.
                    Delegation (CFM(46) (NY)60)<anchor n="51"
                        xml:id="d396-f2"/> outlining <pb facs="1500" n="1476" xml:id="pg1476"/> the
                    respective Delegations’ views on the procedure for the discussion at the
                    Council’s next Session of questions connected with Germany and Austria.</p>
                <p>After an exchange of views the discussion was adjourned.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>Monday, December 9, 1946, at 4 p.m.</p>
